ntent": "Instructions: Listen to the audio. Type in the missing words. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " You have 2 attempts to submit your answers.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "TYP", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 10, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0}, {"id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 11, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn11le12ob03re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Write a TV commercial.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn11le12ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=strong>Denise</span>: Thanks for meeting with me to discuss publicity for the book, Marisa. I've invited Kristi as well, as it seems she has some contacts in the media.<br><span class=strong>Marisa</span>: No problem at all. I know how important it can be to generate a little buzz. <br><span class=strong>Denise</span>: Personally, I'm hoping for more than buzz. I want a tidal wave of publicity, which is why we have already come up with an exhaustive game plan for promotion. <br><span class=strong>Marisa</span>: It was claimed that BFP was the best, but now I'm really beginning to see why. No stone is left unturned. <br>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn11le12ob03re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=strong>Denise</span>: Thanks Marisa. We really try to exceed expectations. First of all, it was pointed out that Winnie is a tech-savvy hedgehog, so wouldn't it make sense for her to have her own twitter account? I've already had our team come up with a logo. The account will be called \u201cWinnie's Wisdom\u201d and she will tweet helpful and safe social media tips. <br><span class=strong>Marisa</span>: What a great idea! I've always wanted to see Winnie brought to life, and now it seems as though you have already made it happen. I love it.\n<br>\n<span class=strong>Denise</span>: Good, I'm glad you're on board. We'd also like to get your face out there. Kristi has worked on both radio and television, and she has already proposed a few ideas.<br><span class=strong>Kristi</span>: To start with, I have some contacts at the radio station. It was mentioned by the director that a few time slots might need to be filled, particularly in the morning.<br>", "id": 2, "time": "31000", "image": "engenn11le12ob03re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=strong>Denise</span>: The morning is great. That allows us to hit our target demographic, parents and kids, while they are eating breakfast. Have you also spoken with<br><span class=italic> Breakfast Television?</span><br><span class=strong>Kristi</span>: An interview was requested, but we're waiting to hear back about the exact time. It will air Saturday morning, but the taping will probably occur sometime Friday afternoon. Do those times work with your schedule, Marisa?<br><span class=strong>Marisa</span>: I'll make it work. I know how important that is to the success of the book.<br><span class=strong>Denise</span>: Thanks for being such a good sport, Marisa. Well, we don't want to overwhelm you, so let's start with those three items and go from there.<br><span class=strong>Marisa</span>: Sounds good, Denise. As always, thank you for your diligence. <br>", "id": 3, "time": "79200", "image": "engenn11le12ob03re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le12ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le12ob03re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}